Design a 3-to-8 binary decoder. The module takes a 3-bit input and activates one of the eight outputs corresponding to the binary value of the input, where each output represents a different power of two (1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128). If the input does not match any valid 3-bit value, the output is set to zero.
module top_module(
    input [2:0] In, 
    output reg [7:0] Out 
);

