description:
Design a Hamming encoder that converts an 11-bit input data vector into a 14-bit encoded output by calculating and appending parity bits to aid in error detection and correction. The module computes four parity bits based on specific combinations of the input bits, allowing it to maintain data integrity in transmission by enabling the detection of single-bit errors in the encoded data. The output combines the original data bits and the computed parity bits in a defined format.
module top_module(
    input [10:0] d,
    output [14:0] c
);

